      "source": [
        "# Asynchronous generator\n",
        "\n",
        "An asynchronous generator is an asynchronous iterator produced by an asynchronous generator function. Its iteration can suspend while waiting for asynchronous work.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-asynchronous-generator)"
      ]
    }
